OL,3,GNEWSAButler who served royalty shares
OL,4,Ahis etiquette tips
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 59-year-old has also worked at
OL,7,Fpolitical summits, including one
OL,8,Fattended by US President Donald Trump
OL,9,Fin Saudi Arabia.
OL,11,FWhen asked for his top tip when meeting
OL,12,Fnew people, he said: "Never assume or
OL,13,Fpresume, and also you never get a
OL,14,Fsecond chance to make a first
OL,15,Fimpression.
